msgstr ""
"Razmak slike (ne-prekidajući). Širina cifre ako cifre imaju fiksnu širinu u "
"ovom fontu."

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:159
msgid ""
"Punctuation Space. Width the same as between a punctuation character and the "
"next character."
msgstr ""
"Razmak nakon znaka interpunkcije. Širina je ista kao i između znaka "
"interpunkcije i narednog znaka."

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:161
msgid ""
"Thin space, in HTML also &amp;thinsp;. See U+202f and <a href=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_(punctuation)\">Wikipedia:Space_(punctuation)</a>"
msgstr ""
"Uski razmak, u HTML-u također &amp;thinsp;. Pogledajte U+202f and <a href="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_(punctuation)\">Wikipedia:Space_"
"(punctuation)</a>"

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:163
msgid "Hair Space. Thinner than U+2009."
msgstr "Prostor dlake. Tanje od U+2009."

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:165
msgid ""
"Punctuation Apostrophe. Should be used instead of U+0027. See <a href="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apostrophe\">Wikipedia:Apostrophe</a>"
msgstr ""
"Apostrof kao interpunkcijski znak. Trebao bi biti korišten umjesto U+0027. "
"Pogledajte <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apostrophe\">Wikipedia:"
"Apostrophe</a>"

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:167
msgid ""
"<p>An en Dash (dash of the width of an n).</p><p>Usage examples: In English "
"language for value ranges (1878&#x2013;1903), for relationships/connections "
"(Zurich&#x2013;Dublin). In the German language it is also used (with "
"spaces!) for showing thoughts: &ldquo;Es war &#x2013; wie immer in den "
"Ferien &#x2013; ein regnerischer Tag.</p> <p>See <a href=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Dash\">Wikipedia:Dash</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>En crtica (crtica širine n).</p><p>Primjeri upotrebe: U engleskom jeziku, "
"za različite opsege vrijednosti (1878&#x2013;1903), za relacije/veze "
"(Cirih&#x2013;Dablin). U njemačkom jeziku može biti korišten (sa razmacima!) "
"za pokazivanje misli: &ldquo;Es war &#x2013; wie immer in den Ferien "
"&#x2013; ein regnerischer Tag.</p> <p>Pogledajte <a href=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Dash\">Wikipedia:Dash</a></p>"

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:169
msgid ""
"<p>An em Dash (dash of the width of an m).</p><p>Usage examples: In English "
"language to mark&#x2014;like here&#x2014;thoughts. Traditionally without "
"spaces. </p><p>See <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dash\">Wikipedia:"
"Dash</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Em crtica (crtica širine m).</p><p>Primjeri upotrebe: U engleskom jeziku "
"za označavanje&#x2014;kao ovdje&#x2014;misli. Uobičajeno bez razmaka. </"
"p><p>Pogledajte <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dash\">Wikipedia:"
"Dash</a></p>"

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:171
msgid ""
"<p>Narrow no-break space. Has the same width as U+2009.</p><p>Usage: For "
"units (spaces are marked with U+2423, &#x2423;): 230&#x2423;V, "
"&#x2212;21&#x2423;&deg;C, 50&#x2423;lb, <em>but</em> 90&deg; (no space). In "
"German for abbreviations (like: i.&#x202f;d.&#x202f;R. instead of i.&#xa0;d."
"&#xa0;R. with U+00a0).</p><p>See <a href=\"http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Schmales_Leerzeichen\">Wikipedia:de:Schmales_Leerzeichen</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Uski razmak bez automatskog preloma reda. Ima istu širinu kao U+2009.</"
"p><p>Upotreba: Za jedinice (razmaci su označeni sa U+2423, &#x2423;): "
"230&#x2423;V, &#x2212;21&#x2423;&deg;C, 50&#x2423;lb, <em>ali</em> 90&deg; "
"(bez razmaka). U njemačkom jeziku za skraćenice (kao što su: i.&#x202f;d."
"&#x202f;R. umjesto i.&#xa0;d.&#xa0;R. with U+00a0).</p><p>Pogledajte <a href="
"\"http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schmales_Leerzeichen\">Wikipedia:de:"
"Schmales_Leerzeichen</a></p>"

#: src/titler/unicodedialog.cpp:173
